TO BE CHOSEN BY THE OWNER

This file is a placeholder, on purpose.

No licence has been chosen for Boma Bot yet. Until the owner writes one here, the default is
"all rights reserved": the code may be read and run locally, but it may not be redistributed and
contributions cannot be accepted. Choose before the repository is published, and before the first
external contribution is merged.

Checklist for the owner:

1. Pick a licence (or a dual licence) and paste its canonical text below this notice.
2. Keep `license-file = "LICENSE"` in `Cargo.toml`, and re-run `cargo deny check` so the
   dependency allow-list in `deny.toml` matches the chosen terms.
3. Record the choice in `docs/STATE.md` and in `docs/DEPENDENCIES.md` (the "project licence" row).
4. BoardUI: the free components are usable, but confirm the terms before publishing if a Pro
   component or template ever lands in the tree (`docs/DEPENDENCIES.md`).
5. Assets: nothing visual was taken from the analysed product. If that changes, record its origin
   and licence in `docs/UI.md` first.
